		(property "Description" "ARM20-CTX 20-Pin to TC2030-IDC Adapter for Cortex                       /catalog/6 6-Pin (TC2030-IDC family) /catalog/9 Cortex SWD /adaptors Adapters\n\njavascript:void(0);\n\nThe Tag-Connect ARM20-CTX adapter&nbsp;board allows our TC2030-IDC cables to be used for ARM SWD (Single Wire Debug) applications. Although intended for use with our patented TC2030-IDC (and TC2030-IDC-NL) Plug-of-Nails™ Cables, the adapter may be useful to people wishing to use 6-pin 0.1” ribbon headers on their PCB instead of the traditional 20-Pin header.\n\nPlease note the http://tag-connect.com/TC2030-IDC TC2030-IDC or http://tag-connect.com/TC2030-IDC-NL TC2030-IDC-NL cable is purchased separately, the cables and Segger JLINK seen in the pictures are not included!\n\nhttp://www.tag-connect.com/Materials/ARM20-CTX.pdf Download the Datasheet here."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
